    {
      "name": "audit_library",
      "description": "Diagnose the library. All checks run by default: missing_bpm, missing_key, key_unreadable_by_serato, stale, not_in_any_crate, streaming_only, duplicates, broken_paths. broken_paths reads Serato's own missing flag by default and ALSO walks the filesystem with check_filesystem: true -- opt-in because a stat against a disconnected drive blocks for seconds. Each check reports a count and up to 10 example track ids; duplicates reports groups instead, since which track duplicates which is the actionable part. missing_key counts tracks with no key at all, while key_unreadable_by_serato counts tracks whose key this server can read but Serato itself cannot display.",
      "inputSchema": {
